      "sourceText": "`num_threads=4` 控制邻域估计、建树及匹配的并行计算。降采样调用没有传这个参数，当前库该函数默认4线程；把参数改大，不等于所有步骤都跟着增加线程。它不是节点频率，也不保证线程翻倍就快一倍，先沿用当前值。",
      "translatedText": "`num_threads=4`Control parallel computation for neighborhood estimation, tree building, and matching\\. The downsampling call does not pass this parameter, and in the current library this function defaults to 4 threads; increasing the parameter does not mean that all steps will increase their thread count accordingly\\. It is not the node frequency, nor does it guarantee that doubling the threads will double the speed; for now, continue using the current value\\.",
